cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Sectoral Keyword Extraction Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A taxonomy-guided, unsupervised pipeline that classifies German trade
  register business purposes into NACE Rev. 2 sections and extracts
  sector-aware keywords using multilingual sentence embeddings and guided
  KeyBERT.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Dikbıyık"
    given-names: "Dilay"
keywords:
  - natural language processing
  - keyword extraction
  - multilingual embeddings
  - NACE Rev. 2
  - zero-shot classification
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dilaydikbiyik/keyword-extractor"
